@MoissonMontreal.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5297

GET {{MoissonMontreal.Api_HostAddress}}/health
###

### Price history of a catalog item (replace the id; requires a bearer token)
GET {{MoissonMontreal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###

### Price of a catalog item in effect on a day
GET {{MoissonMontreal.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/prices/in-effect?date=2026-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
